# Template for .env (gitignored, never commit the real file).
# Copy to .env and fill in real values: `cp .env.example .env`
#
# Nothing in fpl/ or dashboard/ reads env vars yet — no source in this repo
# is currently token-authenticated. This file exists so the FIRST one that
# is (v4 plan §I2's bzzoiro re-evaluation, or an odds API) has somewhere to
# go that isn't a doc that gets circulated. scripts/check_secrets.py's
# pre-commit hook (scripts/install_hooks.py) blocks committing a real value
# accidentally pasted here or anywhere else in the tree.

# BZZOIRO_API_TOKEN=
